                "position": {
                  "x": 20,
                  "y": 104
                },
                "description": "Retrieve the payment instrument on file for a customer. Use when processing a refund or displaying payment details on a resolution form and a customer ID is available. Do NOT expose raw card numbers or paypal_username — mask before surfacing to any UI or agent. Returns: payment_type, card_number, card_holder_name, card_expiry, paypal_username.\n\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- **200** (Success): OK\n  - Content-Type: `application/json`\n\n  - **Response Properties:**\n\n  - **Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"payment_info\": \"unknown_type\"\n}\n```",
                "display_name": "Fetch Payment Info",
                "input_schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "customer_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "[Required] Customer ID in format C-*, e.g. C-3DBZFE."
                    }
                  }
                },
                "output_schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "payment_info": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "card_expiry": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "card_number": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "x-ibm-is-sensitive": true,
                          "x-ibm-masking-policy": "mask-via-regex",
                          "x-ibm-masking-regex-config": {
                            "text-pattern": "(\\d{4})-(\\d{4})-(\\d{4})-(\\d{4})",
                            "masking-pattern": "XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-$4"
                          }
                        },
                        "customer_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "payment_type": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "paypal_username": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "x-ibm-is-sensitive": true,
                          "x-ibm-masking-policy": "mask-via-regex",
                          "x-ibm-masking-regex-config": {
                            "text-pattern": "^(.*)(.{4})(@.*)$",
                            "masking-pattern": "$1xxxx$3"
                          }
                        },
                        "card_holder_name": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "error_handler_config": {
                  "max_retries": 0,
                  "error_message": "Something went wrong while running 'Fetch Payment Info'",
                  "retry_interval": 1000
                }
              },
