                },
                "description": "Evaluate the fraud risk level and risk score for a customer and claim/transaction amount. Returns risk level (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH), numerical score (0-100), prior dispute count, and risk evaluation flags. Use to evaluate risk when processing claims, refunds, or high-value resolutions.\n\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- **200** (Success): OK\n  - Content-Type: `application/json`\n\n  - **Response Properties:**\n\n  - **Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"fraud_risk_assessment\": \"unknown_type\"\n}\n```",
